    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Doran Estates are delighted to present 35 The Sycamores, a bright and spacious top-floor apartment set within the mature and well-maintained Stradbrook Hill development.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hall, generous living room with feature fireplace, separate kitchen, double bedroom and main bathroom. \r\n\r\nStradbrook Hill is surrounded by beautifully landscaped communal gardens, providing attractive outdoor space within the development. The location is particularly convenient, with Monkstown, Deansgrange, Blackrock and Dún Laoghaire all within easy reach.\r\nThere is an excellent range of amenities nearby, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities. Transport links are also well catered for, with Dublin Bus services close by and DART and mainline rail services available from Blackrock and Dún Laoghaire.\r\nFor those who enjoy an active lifestyle, the surrounding area offers a wide choice of golf, tennis, rugby, football, sailing, gyms and watersports, while the coast and countryside provide plenty of opportunities for walking and relaxation.\r\n35 The Sycamores offers well-proportioned accommodation in a mature development in a highly convenient South Dublin location.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: \r\nWelcoming entrance hallway \r\nLiving Room: (5.94m x 3.04m)\r\nLiving room with fireplace\r\nKitchen: (2.08m x 1.67m)\r\nTiled floor with tiled splashback, kitchen units with wall and floor storage \r\nBedroom: (4.27m x 2.37m)\r\n\r\nBathroom: (1.93m x 1.67m)\r\n\r\nPlease note that Doran Estates have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services and cannot verify their working condition or provide any warranty in relation thereto. Interested parties are strongly advised to carry out their own inspections and satisfy themselves regarding the condition and functionality of all items prior to the completion of the sale. Floor plans are provided for illustrative purposes only; all measurements are approximate and may not be to scale. Photographs are for guidance only and may not represent the current state of the property. Doran Estates would recommend that all purchaser carry out a full and detailed inspection of the property themselves as well as engaging a surveyor to carryout an inspection on their behalf."
      }
    ],
